Z||000000||NEFA||07-25-2001||11:22 AM||||I will be going, Josh<P><FONT COLOR="#ff0000">This message is By FierofanNH@aol.com</FONT><BR>For those of you going to the car show this Saturday, July 28th it is located in Jaffrey N.H near the corners of Howard hill road and Squantum Rd. I've never been to this one myself so I can't tell you all to much more.<BR>The gates open at 8am and ends at 3pm. Registration closes at 11 and voting <BR>is to be done by noon. Cost is $10 day of show, unless you pre-registered. Looks like our class will be 'special interest'. Awards are 1-2-3, best of show and peoples choice.<BR>Hope to see you all there. Anyone wanted to stop by my house and follow us over in the morning can if they would like. E-mail me for directions to the house-Andrew.<BR><P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fieropride.com/logos/NEFA_Logo12_small.gif">   <BR><A HREF="http://www.fieropride.com/calendar.htm" TARGET=_blank>Upcoming Club Events</A> <P><A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/jaygee79/tshirt.html" TARGET=_blank>Get your Club T-shirt</A>||||reg||7
